{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a7a08794b1133ddd2b09f8fced44733d15da8e62d6fd59209aeb570f1a0e6aba", "ja": "（今日は美奈子と風花が映画の宣伝も兼ねて、\nバラエティ番組に出演することになった……）", "zh": "（今天美奈子和风花要出演综艺节目，顺便为电影做宣传……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "7110f5603fd3ded0c9b56a683215efecb1ebe8211565125d00c041a8bd40bd40", "ja": "わっほ～い！　もうすぐ本番ですね、風花さん！\nなんだかワクワクしてきちゃいました！", "zh": "哇——好开心！马上就要正式录制了呢，风花姐！\n我都开始期待起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "870d72a5868f78c0718fc68879783ee149b3c7d7a0d63636784ab4fac8053875", "ja": "すごいな、美奈子ちゃん。私なんて、緊張しちゃって。\nちゃんと映画の魅力を伝えられるかな……。", "zh": "真厉害啊，美奈子。我都紧张起来了。\n不知道能不能好好传达出电影的魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "2aec1a5ffeacead58d0be69308a81db4601f63451b2e2ec30dcd9a72bc2c9045", "ja": "風花さん、心配しないでください！\n今日は作品の代表として、私達が頑張る日です！", "zh": "风花姐，请不要担心！\n今天是由我们代表这部作品努力的一天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "18336d2e68208d8126787326feb5518dbbd690869766c34a2598c2d1714c87d2", "ja": "風花さんが困ってたら、私がフォローします！\nだから、その……私が困った時は助けてくださいね♪", "zh": "要是风花姐遇到困难，我会帮忙的！\n所以，那个……我遇到困难的时候，你也要帮帮我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f341cee280239da158cc0d8c6246f1827910f327e6d1c804f903a9cb225a2800", "ja": "もちろんだよ、美奈子ちゃん！　ふふっ。\nそうだね、ふたり一緒ならきっと大丈夫だよね。", "zh": "当然啦，美奈子！呵呵。\n是啊，只要我们两个人一起，肯定没问题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1ed0339537f41749bedcc59a36f36208b76e3d8deb316a87407a9aa9394d0445", "ja": "お疲れ様。なんだか出る幕はなかったけど……。\n俺も、ちゃんとフォローするからな！", "zh": "辛苦了。总觉得好像没我发挥的余地，不过……\n我也会好好支持你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a65a59aa8382ab93375654e3d1d73a7616df30e1579f7c093e7ef79aceff1300", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます♪\nみんなで作った映画、しっかり宣伝してきますね！", "zh": "好的，谢谢您♪  \n我们一起制作的电影，我会好好去宣传的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "586fbaa68ecc0315f2de1ad7bea8669bcb500a7fa556d85e7afec11683684971", "ja": "そういえば、最後にアピールタイムがあるんですよね？\n今のうちに何をするか決めておきませんか？", "zh": "说起来，最后还有宣传时间，对吧？  \n要不要趁现在先决定好要做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f3c92c63fece4faee21dcf793a8bedfc2b60af8f4bc45878554f950af6f73255", "ja": "そうだね。あとで考える時間があるかわからないし。\n{$P$}さんも、それで良いですか？", "zh": "是啊。之后不知道有没有时间考虑。\n{$P$}先生，这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1010_p", "source_sha256": "483f13d1f759a781705aec7fa2644edf82cb74a52e41627fe599c4213bad745a", "ja": "うん。本番まで時間があるし、\nふたりがどんなアピールをするかも興味あるしな。", "zh": "嗯。离正式开始还有时间，\n而且我也很感兴趣你们两个人会展现出怎样的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "ddee3c62a761fe91a478dff29e36d03a930c07377df48d8ecee75a736be22866", "ja": "それじゃあ、まずは掴みで……キメポーズから！\n{$P$}さん、見ててくださいね♪", "zh": "那么，先用招牌动作抓住大家的注意……从定格姿势开始！\n{$P$}先生，请看好了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8eded30524277506e8e81ce538dc16e22f0e58b50af31af38f01275012b9b424", "ja": "キメ……ええ～～～っ！？　ちょっと待って、\n美奈子ちゃん！　どうして最初にポーズからなの？", "zh": "摆……摆姿势……诶——！？等一下，\n美奈子！为什么一开始就要摆姿势啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "2212c93aa7945455dcd20a7f76418bd5325e51e419d704802274fd56d5dd0e49", "ja": "私達、ダンサーの役じゃないですか。知ってもらうには\nそれが一番かなって。あとインパクトもありますし！", "zh": "我们演的不是舞者吗？要让大家认识我们，我觉得那是最好的办法。而且也很有冲击力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "78acc4486884cc7732d28f7c6bb39c05ea071b1ae6a10733bfb143c976e3183f", "ja": "それにキメポーズの風花さん、とっても綺麗ですから！\nみなさんにいっぱい見てもらいましょう！", "zh": "而且，摆出定格姿势的风花姐特别漂亮！让大家好好欣赏一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "06fdf354bf1c8c9835934ac5550d55484a8ce622ce85f5625453a62ddf1835cb", "ja": "で、でもあれは、少しセクシーすぎないかな？\nそれより今は練習なんだから、やらなくても……。", "zh": "可、可是那个，会不会有点太性感了？\n而且现在是在练习，不做也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "b48ed208b3deb9311ddd1d9c8607ac1dcebc78a727f6620a98b5cb5dbbc0e508", "ja": "大丈夫です。練習だからこそ、思い切りやりましょう！\nそれじゃあ、いきますよ～。……さん、はいっ！", "zh": "没关系的。正因为是练习，才更要放开手脚去做！\n那么，要开始咯～。……预备，开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "51f418980f480dbe9cbd081c90e3cc9636c2671fd8c20fc2123bdb8d07ebcc48", "ja": "ええっ！？　ちょっと待って、美奈子ちゃん！\n心の準備が～！？", "zh": "诶诶！？等等，美奈子！\n我还没做好心理准备呢～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0324_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c68b6006eb35871373bdcb8b2f9c5be7efca5e76e73be62d10bc5d07ef6c63b8", "ja": "（本番前の練習のおかげで、映画の宣伝は大成功！\nしっかり者のふたりに任せて正解だったな！）", "zh": "（多亏了正式演出前的练习，电影宣传大获成功！交给这两个可靠的人果然没错！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
